From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:54:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] configs: mediatek_mobile: service the watchdog, xsphy
 USB, steady fastboot

- Start and service the watchdog: the preloader leaves the RGU running
  and the stock LK hands over with it enabled; mtk_wdt stops it at probe,
  so restart it with a 15 s timeout (the driver's maximum is ~16 s) and
  let the cyclic framework feed it during waits.
- Use the xsphy USB PHY driver found on MT6897 devices instead of t-phy.
- Do not abort fastboot on key events: a misread key must not end the
  USB session.
- Export the version string as ${ver} for on-screen banners.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig b/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
index fea22cc0c40..dee8a514327 100644
--- a/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ CONFIG_LOG_MAX_LEVEL=7
 CONFIG_LOG_DEFAULT_LEVEL=6
 # CONFIG_DISPLAY_CPUINFO is not set
 CONFIG_HUSH_PARSER=y
+CONFIG_VERSION_VARIABLE=y
 CONFIG_CMD_BOOTI=y
 CONFIG_CMD_BOOTMENU=y
 CONFIG_CMD_BOOTEFI=y
@@ -35,7 +36,6 @@ CONFIG_CMD_UFS=y
 CONFIG_CMD_USB=y
 CONFIG_CMD_USB_MASS_STORAGE=y
 CONFIG_CMD_UMS_ABORT_KEYED=y
-CONFIG_CMD_FASTBOOT_ABORT_KEYED=y
 CONFIG_CMD_PAUSE=y
 CONFIG_CMD_FAT=y
 CONFIG_CMD_EXT4=y
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@ CONFIG_FASTBOOT_BUF_SIZE=0x8000000
 # CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH is not set
 CONFIG_FASTBOOT_CMD_OEM_CONSOLE=y
 CONFIG_PHY=y
-CONFIG_PHY_MTK_TPHY=y
+CONFIG_PHY_MTK_XSPHY=y
 CONFIG_PINCTRL=y
 CONFIG_RESET_TI_SYSCON=y
 CONFIG_SCSI=y
@@ -88,7 +88,7 @@ CONFIG_VIDEO_SIMPLE=y
 CONFIG_NO_FB_CLEAR=y
 CONFIG_SYS_WHITE_ON_BLACK=y
 CONFIG_WDT=y
-# CONFIG_WATCHDOG_AUTOSTART is not set
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MSECS=15000
 CONFIG_WDT_MTK=y
 # CONFIG_PANIC_HANG is not set
 # CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM is not set
